{
  "body_human_readable": "The tools mentioned for working with ontologies are:\n\n1. Prot\u00e9g\u00e9\n2. TopBraid Composer\n3. OntoStudio (and its predecessor OntoEdit)\n4. Fluent Editor\n5. VocBench 3\n6. Swoop\n7. OBO-Edit\n\nThese tools are discussed as ontology editors and environments for building, maintaining, and exploring ontologies, each with its own features and strengths [1].[2].[3].[4].[5].[6].",
